---
description: Testing rules for TinyBrain OS
globs:
  - "**/*_test.go"
alwaysApply: true
---

# Testing

- Table-driven tests preferred
- Test file naming: `{package}_test.go` or `{file}_test.go`
- Run `go test ./...` before completing any task
- Test boundary violations: scheduler must not import inference packages
- ProcessState tests in `internal/process/state_test.go` are the reference pattern
